==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{Dan.|is}} {{term|bil}}, a shortened form of {{term|automobil}}, ultimately from {{AGr.|is}} {{term|αὐτός|tr=autós||self}}, stem αὐτo- (''auto-'') + {{L.|is}} {{term|mobilis||mobile}}, ergo ‘[vehicle] which moves by itself’.

